# inc-r6u1: Searing Light against a LIVING target at the game's maximum
# reachable effective caster level (Priest 11, ChallengeRating 11). The giant
# rat is MA_ANIMAL, so CalcEffect picks the `tval: MA_LIVING` branch --
# `(LEVEL_SCALED2)d8`, which the Desc caps at 5d8.
#
# At caster level 11 this branch is already at its cap (min(5,11/2)=5), so the
# before and after dice are both 5d8; the living half of the defect only shows
# at caster level 15 or higher, which MAX_CHAR_LEVEL=11 makes unreachable. The
# undead script is where the defect is visible in play (9d6 -> 10d6).
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_RUN_DIR="$PWD/logs/inc-r6u1/living" \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/searing-light-living.keys 1
@include searing-light-cl11-setup.keys
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Animals"
@choose "giant rat"
RIGHT
ENTER
@dump:living-summoned
m
@choose "Searing Light"
RIGHT
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:living-after-cast
v
@dump:living-messages
@while "Messages" ESC
@quit
